{
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.01": "我以为%79$s已经给收税的交过了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.02": "问%27$s去。%79$s当时就在场。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.03": "听说宫廷还在为%21$s服丧。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.04": "有消息说，%13$s被人瞧见夜里离开了%2$s。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.05": "听说%7$s已经好几天没在宫廷露面了。当真有人跟这位君主说上过话吗？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.06": "他们说的%2$s那事，是真的吗？我都听过三个版本了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.07": "听说%66$s正在起草新的令状。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.08": "听说眼下宫廷里有%119$s位公爵、%120$s位领主，可还是什么都办不成。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.09": "这井水又变味了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.10": "那道篱笆你修好了没有？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.11": "你看着挺累的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.12": "我梦见鸡在密谋对付我。你要是瞧见了准得笑。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.13": "我用一双好靴子换了一袋芜菁。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.14": "面包师一口咬定他的面包能治好腰背痛。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.15": "我拿一颗绿宝石跟你赌，雨到天黑都下不来。你赌不赌？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.16": "据说要是水井一年里干两回，村里就得死人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.17": "我敢说，那只猫从赶集那天起就一直跟着我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.18": "昨儿夜里那只狐狸又叼走了我一只鸡。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.19": "我已经一星期没睡个整觉了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.20": "我想跟屠夫讨价还价，结果吃了大亏。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.21": "我觉得邻居家那只鸡中了邪。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.22": "今早的面包没发起来。我娘总说这是凶兆。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.23": "天没亮铁匠就在敲打了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.24": "渔夫好几天一条鱼都没打上来，我寻思是不是出了什么岔子？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.25": "昨晚铁匠铺附近动了手。半条街都在议论。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.26": "屠夫要价是上个月的两倍。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.27": "那个傻子想拿一只裂了口的碗按原价卖给我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.28": "春天那双靴子，我还欠着皮匠的钱呢。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.29": "孩子们又扮了一上午的骑士。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.30": "孩子们一直缠着要学弓箭。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.31": "有人老让自家鸡跑进我的菜园。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.32": "我想一口气搬太多鸡蛋，后来的事嘛，你猜也猜得到。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.33": "我今早听说%69$s从%155$s带来了消息。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.34": "听说%7$s开朝议一直开到天黑透了才散。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.35": "听说%7$s一直在打听村里的事。也不知已经问过谁了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.36": "据说与%155$s的关系正在好转。也许往后能在这儿多见到些他们的人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.37": "听说咱们如今跟%155$s交好了。我倒想见见那边来的人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.38": "有人说%155$s的使节今天到了。你见着了吗？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.39": "今早有个骑士差点把我撞进泥里。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.40": "你觉得%11$s日后会是个好君主吗？好像人人都有话说。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.41": "有人把我的衣裳从晾衣绳上偷走了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.42": "昨儿我在地板下摸到三颗绿宝石。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.43": "有人一直在摘我树上的苹果。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.44": "鸟是不留脚印的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.45": "那条狗从我手里直接把香肠叼走了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.46": "我家门又犯那种响动了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.47": "武器匠打了一把新剑。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.48": "新剑没人使，打它又有什么用？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.49": "近来客栈里的人没那么多。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.50": "当心。墙上有耳朵。半个广场上也都是。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.51": "王室若要人忠心，就该先从好面包做起。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.52": "不知%8$s%7$s俯瞰这一切时，心里想的是什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.53": "镇上最老的石头见过的君主，比我们这辈子能见的还多。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.54": "每个大家族，都是从某个人站在村中广场上开始的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.55": "我怀念这地方还小得能认全每张脸的时候。如今想必只是要认识的人更多了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.56": "孩子们长得比房子盖得还快。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.57": "今天在客栈附近见着三张生面孔。我兴许去自报个家门。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.58": "进%2$s的路比往常热闹。过往的生人不少。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.59": "咱们有%3$s个居民，却只有一处像样的嚼舌根地方。难怪大伙儿总守在那儿。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.60": "%2$s要是再这么扩下去，咱们就得再打一口井了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.61": "首都的闲话足够养活%3$s口人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.62": "我数了数，有%3$s名居民，其中一半挡了我的道。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.63": "这个时辰，路上的尘土哪儿都是。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.64": "但愿我的床还在我放下的地方。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.65": "我是从面包师那儿听来的，他又从卫兵那儿听来。总有人知道最初那个版本吧。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.66": "闲话就是这么起来的，这回我可不想再背黑锅。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.67": "方才我听见些古怪动静，可我没去查看。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.68": "别跟人说这话是我讲的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.69": "不，我不解释。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.70": "我跟你说，那只鸡知道些什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.71": "我这不是迷信。我这是有阅历。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.72": "广场附近的猫越来越有组织了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.73": "有人说该让那只鸡来统治%2$s。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.extroverted.call.evening.74": "市场附近又到处都是鸡了。"
}
